# Runtime output dirs (session captures, audit taps). Anchored to the two
# working directories the stack runs from — do NOT un-anchor: source dirs
# named `captures/`, `sessions/`, and `audit/` exist under voice-pipes/src
# and voice-pipes-admin.
/captures/
/captures-*/
/sessions/
/audit/
/audit_tap/
